# RunicAI Evaluation Harness

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:runic_ai, path: ".."}
])
```

Use evaluation cases to turn expected behavior into repeatable checks.

```elixir
alias RunicAI.Evaluation.Case

Case.new!(
  id: "hello-case",
  input: %{user: "say hello"},
  expected: [{:contains_text, "hello"}]
)
```

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  cases[Evaluation cases] --> harness[Evaluation harness]
  harness --> recipe[Recipe run]
  recipe --> results[Case results]
  results --> aggregate[Aggregate metrics]
```
